[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> # Let's check correctness of (to, from):
[?2004l[?2004h> # U -> M  => M is to, U is from -> ('M', 'U')
[?2004l[?2004h> # U -> Y  => Y is to, U is from -> ('Y', 'U')
